    "rowKey": "Wolfsbane\n\nResurgence Directive\nNano-Assault",
    "section": "Power Weapons",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Solar Heavy Axe\nUses Twilight Arsenal's Axes Animations. Sword Energy is visibly displayed in the Melee Ability icon.\n\nLight Attacks deal 470 [377] Damage grant 30% Sword Energy and spawn 3 Quicksilver Nanites every 3 attacks or on kill.\nHeavy Attacks, while having at least 10% Sword Energy, consume 3 Ammo to launch a Solar Wave that travels 10 meters forward, dealing 675 [301] Damage.\nAirborne Heavy Attacks consume 2 Ammo and always send out a Solar Wave, regardless of Sword Energy.\nWolfsbane deals up to 25% increased damage against enemies with Outbreak Perfected's Nanites.\n\nQuicksilver Nanites restore ? HP on pickup and grant 5% Nano-Assault progress, requiring 21 Nanites to max out.\nHold [Reload] upon reaching 100% Nano-Assault to trigger Overclock.\nQuicksilver Nanites generated from attacks against ~~ A F F L I C T E D enemies with Outbreak Perfected Nanites grant ?% increased Nano Assault progress.\n\nOverclock | Enhanced Offensive Capabilities for 12 seconds.\nGenerates +14 Ammo, 25% increased damage, and 30% Sword Energy/s.\nHeavy Attacks always launch a Solar Wave.\nFully Charged Heavy Attacks's Solar Wave explodes, dealing 421?? [376] Damage over ? meters and create a Swarm-Nado. Explosion has no falloff.\nSwarm-Nado deals 55? [55] Damage every 0.3 seconds over 5? meters for 3 seconds.\nStowing Wolfsbane before the buff runs out sets its Nano-Assault Progress to 25%.\n\nGrants Damage Resist for 5 seconds upon scoring Light Attack Hits within 4 seconds of each.\nDamage Resist strength and hit requirements are variable, with both being determined by the equipped handle.\nUnyielding = 15% DR after 2 hits | Rampager's = 20% DR after 3 hits | Tenacious = 30% DR after 4 hits | Guardian = 5% DR for all handles\nCan be triggered even without Ammo. Can be refreshed by retriggering the Damage Resist effect. Does not trigger while in Super.\n\n↑Selectable Retrofit:\nGrants the option to slot-in Relentless Strikes, Attrition Orbs, Burning Ambition, and SUBROUTINE: ~RECURSION.\n~RECURSION | Nanites restore up to 3x HP per stack of Nano-Assault. Releases 2 Nanites every ? damage taken while Nano-Assault is active with a 2s CD.",
